  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4b1f1c173840a95371ea902e23b59b122f370e02.png\" alt=\"HMI 編輯器\"></p>\n<p><strong>&quot;HMI&quot; 編輯器 - 是一個客戶端模組，提供便捷的滑桿，用於在 &quot;Hold My Items&quot; 中編輯手中物件的姿態和變換。</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9a56d12f9dbf9692aa45c2fb42b55d201b5ea714.png\" alt=\"---\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/39c67eff74a9810995d69fcff3b17f0eeac3a7cc.png\" alt=\"# 要開啟選單，請按 &quot;N&quot; \"> <strong>(目前的熱鍵是 &quot;N&quot;，但你可以在遊戲設定中更改它)</strong></p>\n<h2>功能</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<h3>- 提供PosX/posY/posZ、rotX/rotY/rotZ 和縮放的滑桿。</h3>\n<h3>- 編輯你手中的物品。</h3>\n<h3>- 在主手和副手之間切換。</h3>\n<h3>- 獨立的持物姿態編輯器。</h3>\n<h3>- 範本：建立、套用、重新命名和刪除。</h3>\n<h2>- 自動將設定儲存至配置檔案</h2>\n<h3><strong>所有姿態都會儲存到檔案中 -</strong> <em>minecraft/config/hmieditor.json</em></h3>\n</blockquote>\n<p>如果你發現任何錯誤，請告訴我：undefined</p>\n<h3><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252fusers%252f619895750440124416\" rel=\"nofollow\">- 我的 Discord</a></h3>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/Twj9bS4f/Video.gif\" alt=\"gif\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9a56d12f9dbf9692aa45c2fb42b55d201b5ea714.png\" alt=\"---\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6231b7644f235c9e72eca199b90242e38f243b16_0.webp\" alt=\"主選單\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9a56d12f9dbf9692aa45c2fb42b55d201b5ea714.png\" alt=\"---\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/03a009966837140dffecefcdf0ce6ccff33024a4.png\" alt=\"使用範例\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/922e09658c66286280e2e0fa2d46470e51d1f95d_0.webp\" alt=\"修改前/後\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9a56d12f9dbf9692aa45c2fb42b55d201b5ea714.png\" alt=\"---\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b284941b0b1bfb241469756d46dc8a804b180ea0_0.webp\" alt=\"修改前/後\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9a56d12f9dbf9692aa45c2fb42b55d201b5ea714.png\" alt=\"---\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>ㅤㅤㅤㅤㅤㅤㅤㅤㅤㅤㅤㅤㅤㅤ[ <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fhold-my-items\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hold My Items</a> ], [ <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a> ], [ <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric Loader</a> ]</strong></p>",
